From 67c9810900e2d8486cb3b11495a8362433494ca0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: hhh2210 <hzy2210@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 8 Aug 2026 19:05:45 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Integrate IKEv1 expandrule payload task and HASH

- Register private IKEv1 payload types 17/18/19 with a raw-header wrapper while reusing the neutral CP4A codec.
- Keep keymat_v1 unchanged and gate protected custom-only contexts onto existing Phase 2 HASH handling; Quick Mode ADDRULE is limited to the final third packet after SA/NONCE negotiation.
- Add an unscheduled, fail-closed companion task plus direction/order negatives and a vendor-static HASH(3) reference-vector test.
- NOTE: task-manager, VICI, SA, route, policy, utun, sender, and live-server integration remain intentionally disconnected.
